---
/**
 * Replaces Starlight's theme provider, which reads a stored preference and the
 * OS setting. The site is dark-only, so the theme is pinned here.
 *
 * This also rescues anyone who previously picked "light" in the old selector:
 * without it their stored preference would persist with no way to change it back.
 */
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
  try {
    localStorage.removeItem('starlight-theme');
  } catch {}
</script>
